#: ../../dev/dev.md:1
msgid "开发指南"
msgstr "Developer guide"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:3
msgid "从项目根目录按[下载与安装](../resources/install.md)创建环境。修改前先用仓库的微型素材跑通目标操作；修改后用相同输入比较显示、缓存和导出结果。"
msgstr ""
"From the repository root, follow [Download and install](../resources/install.md) to create an "
"environment. Reproduce the operation with the small bundled fixtures before editing. Afterward, "
"repeat it with the same inputs and compare the display, cache, and exported files."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:5
msgid "从功能找到入口"
msgstr "Find the implementation"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:7
msgid "下表中的实现文件位于 `src/mulimgviewer/src/`，界面定义位于同级的 `gui/`。"
msgstr ""
"The implementation files below are in `src/mulimgviewer/src/`. The GUI definitions are in the "
"adjacent `gui/` directory."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "要修改的行为"
msgstr "Behaviour to change"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "从这里读起"
msgstr "Start here"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "主窗口、打开来源、按钮和绘图交互"
msgstr "Main window, opening sources, buttons, and drawing interactions"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`main.py`；图像来源与索引数据见 `data.py`"
msgstr "`main.py`. For image sources and index data, see `data.py`."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "拆帧、长视频寻帧、视频缓存调度"
msgstr "Frame extraction, long-video seeking, and video cache scheduling"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`video_source.py`、`video_decoder.py`、`video_manager.py`"
msgstr "`video_source.py`, `video_decoder.py`, `video_manager.py`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "图像异步显示、播放节奏、任务预算"
msgstr "Asynchronous image display, playback timing, and task budgets"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`image_pipeline.py`、`playback_controls.py`、`playback_policy.py`、`pipeline_executor.py`"
msgstr "`image_pipeline.py`, `playback_controls.py`, `playback_policy.py`, `pipeline_executor.py`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "算法执行、布局、缓存路径"
msgstr "Algorithm execution, layout, and cache paths"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`custom_pipeline.py`、`render_layout.py`、`cache_layout.py`"
msgstr "`custom_pipeline.py`, `render_layout.py`, `cache_layout.py`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "后台保存与编码"
msgstr "Background saving and encoding"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`export_controller.py`、`image_encoding.py`"
msgstr "`export_controller.py`, `image_encoding.py`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "配置、右侧设置栏、状态栏和索引表"
msgstr "Configuration, settings sidebar, status bar, and index table"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`configuration.py`、`settings_panel.py`、`status_bar.py`、`index_table.py`"
msgstr "`configuration.py`, `settings_panel.py`, `status_bar.py`, `index_table.py`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:18
msgid "修改 GUI"
msgstr "Change the GUI"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:20
msgid "用 wxFormBuilder 打开对应的 `.fbp`，例如 `src/mulimgviewer/gui/main_gui.fbp`，修改控件和事件绑定。"
msgstr ""
"Open the relevant `.fbp` file, such as `src/mulimgviewer/gui/main_gui.fbp`, in wxFormBuilder. "
"Edit the controls and event bindings there."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:21
msgid ""
"运行 `python tools/generate_gui.py` 重新生成界面。若生成器不在 PATH，在命令末尾加 `--generator \"可执行文件的完整路径\"`。用 "
"`--check` 检查生成文件与定义是否匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Run `python tools/generate_gui.py` to regenerate the interface. If the generator is outside PATH,"
" append `--generator \"full path to executable\"`. Use `--check` to compare the generated files "
"with the definitions."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:22
msgid "在实现层连接回调。布局参数沿用“修改多项后手动刷新”的交互；后台任务使用应用后的设置，保存使用点击时的参数。新增设置需检查加载、保存、重置和旧配置兼容。"
msgstr ""
"Connect callbacks in the implementation layer. Keep layout edits grouped until manual refresh. "
"Background tasks use applied settings, and exports capture settings when Save is clicked. For new"
" controls, check load, save, reset, and compatibility with old configurations."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:23
msgid "打开主窗口实际操作一次，覆盖图像和视频两条入口，再执行对应测试。"
msgstr ""
"Exercise the change in the main window with both image and video inputs, then run the relevant "
"tests."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:25
msgid "添加图像处理算法"
msgstr "Add an image processing algorithm"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:27
msgid "在 `src/mulimgviewer/src/custom_func/<算法名>/main.py` 中实现单图核函数。例如内置的 Gaussian Blur："
msgstr ""
"Implement a single-image kernel in `src/mulimgviewer/src/custom_func/<algorithm>/main.py`. The "
"built-in Gaussian Blur illustrates the interface:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:38
msgid ""
"输入和返回值均为 Pillow 图像，缓存与导出由框架负责。只有可安全并发调用的算法才声明 `THREAD_SAFE = True`。需要复用模型时，用 `setup()` "
"返回上下文，处理函数从 `context` 取得模型；框架在算法会话内复用它。批处理实现 `process_batch(images, *, "
"context)`，输出与输入数量、顺序一致。设备、批量和释放接口可参照仓库的 `examples/custom_func/GPU Sharpen/`。"
msgstr ""
"Accept and return Pillow images. The framework handles caching and export. Declare `THREAD_SAFE ="
" True` only if calls can safely overlap. For a reusable model, return a context from `setup()` "
"and access it through `context` during processing. The framework reuses it within the algorithm "
"session. For batches, implement `process_batch(images, *, context)` and return the same number of"
" outputs in input order. See `examples/custom_func/GPU Sharpen/` for device setup, batching, and "
"cleanup."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:40
msgid ""
"调试时先用 **Selected** 验证单算法，再用 **All algorithms** "
"对照。源帧就绪后，后台可处理各算法，生成各自的拼接，再合成最终页面。检查布局变化、快速跳页和关闭窗口时过期结果的处理；只测单个函数的耗时不能说明整页播放性能。"
msgstr ""
"Start with **Selected** to verify one algorithm, then compare with **All algorithms**. Once "
"source frames are ready, workers process each algorithm, stitch its panel, and compose the final "
"page. Check how stale results behave after layout changes, rapid navigation, and window closure. "
"Measure whole-page playback as well as individual kernels."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:42
msgid "性能与回归"
msgstr "Performance and regression testing"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:44
msgid ""
"做性能对比时固定来源、布局、显示比例、算法和缓存窗口，分别记录冷启动首屏、深处跳转首屏、稳定播放与供给 FPS、CPU "
"和内存。记录性能模式、操作系统和处理器，区分首次构建与已经命中缓存的结果。工具和用法可从 `python "
"auto_test_scripts/performance/benchmark_video_playback.py --help` 开始。"
msgstr ""
"Keep sources, layout, display scale, algorithms, and cache window fixed when comparing runs. "
"Record cold-start time to first page, time to first page after a deep seek, sustained playback "
"and supply FPS, CPU, and memory. Include the power mode, OS, and processor. Report cold and "
"cached results separately. Start with `python "
"auto_test_scripts/performance/benchmark_video_playback.py --help`."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:46
msgid "开发回归测试与 PR 审查"
msgstr "Regression tests and pull request review"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:48
msgid "开发新功能或修复问题时，请按下面的顺序检查已有功能，并把对应的测试报告附在 PR 中，方便维护者审查。"
msgstr ""
"When adding a feature or fixing a bug, follow these steps to check existing behaviour. Attach the"
" resulting report to the pull request for review."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:50
msgid "第 1 步：进入项目并确认 Python 环境"
msgstr "Step 1. Open the repository and verify the Python environment"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:52
msgid ""
"在项目根目录打开终端，此目录应包含 `MulimgViewer.py`、`src` 和 `auto_test_scripts`。使用能够正常启动软件的 Python 环境；如果使用 "
"Conda，将下面的环境名称替换为自己的名称。"
msgstr ""
"Open a terminal at the repository root, which contains `MulimgViewer.py`, `src`, and "
"`auto_test_scripts`. Use a Python environment that can launch the application. For Conda, "
"substitute your environment’s name below."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:59
msgid "下面的测试命令均从项目根目录执行。测试使用独立进程和临时目录，不需要开发者提供自己的图片、视频或个人配置。"
msgstr ""
"Run all test commands from the repository root. Tests use isolated processes and temporary "
"directories with bundled inputs. Personal images, videos, and configuration files are "
"unnecessary."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:61
msgid "第 2 步：安装依赖并准备视频工具"
msgstr "Step 2. Install dependencies and prepare video tools"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:67
msgid "视频测试还需要 FFmpeg 和 FFprobe。如果当前环境没有这两个工具，使用 Conda 的开发者可以执行："
msgstr ""
"Video tests require both FFmpeg and FFprobe. If they are missing, Conda users can install them "
"with the following command."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:73
msgid "测试入口会使用软件的视频工具定位机制检查依赖。依赖缺失时会生成失败报告，不能视为测试通过。"
msgstr ""
"The runner uses the application’s own video tool discovery. A missing dependency produces a "
"failed report."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:75
msgid ""
"Windows 也可以在已激活的环境中双击 `auto_test_scripts/run_tests.cmd`。如果双击时使用了错误的 Python，可在 PowerShell "
"中指定解释器；把示例路径替换为自己的路径。"
msgstr ""
"On Windows, you can also double-click `auto_test_scripts/run_tests.cmd` in the activated "
"environment. If it picks the wrong Python, specify your interpreter in PowerShell, substituting "
"your own path below."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:82
msgid ""
"Linux 和 macOS 可使用同一个 Python 入口，或执行 `sh auto_test_scripts/run_tests.sh`。GUI 测试需要图形会话；无显示器的 Linux "
"环境在安装 Xvfb 后使用："
msgstr ""
"Linux and macOS can use the same Python entry point or `sh auto_test_scripts/run_tests.sh`. GUI "
"tests require a graphical session. On headless Linux, install Xvfb and run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:88
msgid "第 3 步：执行完整回归测试"
msgstr "Step 3. Run the full regression suite"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:94
msgid ""
"等待所有模块结束，确认最终状态为 `PASSED`，且命令退出码为 0。执行通常需要几分钟。`--strict-skips` "
"要求没有跳过的案例；失败、异常、缺少依赖、超时或跳过都会使本次严格检查不通过。"
msgstr ""
"Wait for all modules to finish. Look for `PASSED` and exit code 0. A run typically takes several "
"minutes. With `--strict-skips`, failures, errors, missing dependencies, timeouts, and skipped "
"cases all fail the check."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:96
msgid "执行期间不要修改源码、测试脚本和固定素材，也不要在同一份工作目录同时启动多次全量测试。报告记录提交 SHA、未提交改动，以及源码、测试和素材的指纹；运行期间发生变化时，需要重新执行。"
msgstr ""
"Keep source code, tests, and fixtures unchanged during a run. Run only one full suite per working"
" directory at a time. The report records the commit SHA, uncommitted changes, and fingerprints of"
" source, tests, and assets. Rerun if any change during testing."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:98
msgid ""
"回归范围包括图像和视频播放、四种输入模式、并行与顺序组合、布局与标题、自定义算法、两层缓存、索引与状态栏、配置恢复，以及七种输出组合、三种保存格式、后台保存和暂停续存。固定 "
"PNG、自定义处理和拼接结果使用像素比较，视频解码结果使用已知帧校验。"
msgstr ""
"Coverage includes image and video playback, four input modes, combined parallel/sequential "
"browsing, layouts, titles, algorithms, two-level caching, index and status bar, and configuration"
" restore. Export tests cover seven output combinations, three formats, background saving, and "
"pause/resume. Fixed PNG, processed, and stitched outputs are compared pixel by pixel. Video "
"decoding is checked against known frames."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:100
msgid ""
"固定素材位于 `auto_test_scripts/assets`，包含小型图像、视频、相对路径列表和期望结果，合计约 38 KB。测试不会在正常执行时自动重建期望结果。既有 Windows "
"验证记录位于 `auto_test_scripts/baseline/verified.json`；实际案例数量以本次报告为准。"
msgstr ""
"Fixtures in `auto_test_scripts/assets` include small images, videos, relative path lists, and "
"expected outputs (about 38 KB in total). Normal test runs leave expected outputs untouched. An "
"earlier verified Windows run is recorded in `auto_test_scripts/baseline/verified.json`. Use the "
"current report for actual case counts."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:102
msgid "第 4 步：打开报告并确认结果"
msgstr "Step 4. Open the report and check the result"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:104
msgid ""
"每次执行生成 `auto_test_scripts/reports/<UTC时间>/`。读取 `auto_test_scripts/reports/latest.json` 的 "
"`directory` 字段，即可找到最近一次执行的目录。Windows PowerShell 可执行："
msgstr ""
"Each run creates `auto_test_scripts/reports/<UTC timestamp>/`. Read the `directory` field in "
"`auto_test_scripts/reports/latest.json` to locate the latest run. In Windows PowerShell, use:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "文件"
msgstr "File"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "用途"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`report.html`"
msgstr "`report.html`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "查看功能分组、案例状态、参数子案例和错误堆栈。"
msgstr "Browse feature groups, case and subtest results, and tracebacks."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`report.json`"
msgstr "`report.json`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "核对提交、源码指纹、测试环境和完整结果。"
msgstr "Check the commit, source fingerprint, environment, and full results."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`junit.xml`"
msgstr "`junit.xml`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "供 CI 和 JUnit 工具解析结果。"
msgstr "Provide machine-readable results for CI and JUnit tools."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`summary.md`"
msgstr "`summary.md`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "查看失败、跳过和环境错误摘要。"
msgstr "Read a summary of failures, skips, and environment errors."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`test_*.log`"
msgstr "`test_*.log`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "查看对应测试模块的执行日志。"
msgstr "Inspect a module’s execution log."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:120
msgid ""
"`PASSED` 表示本次选择的案例全部通过，`PASSED_WITH_SKIPS` 表示存在跳过，`FAILED` "
"表示检查未通过。审查完整回归时，还要确认没有未执行的模块、功能分组均完成验证。仅运行部分案例得到的通过结果，不能代替全量报告。"
msgstr ""
"`PASSED` means all selected cases passed. `PASSED_WITH_SKIPS` includes skipped cases. `FAILED` "
"means the check failed. For full regression review, verify every module ran and every feature "
"group was checked. A passing subset only covers the selected cases."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:122
msgid "第 5 步：定位失败并重新验证"
msgstr "Step 5. Diagnose failures and rerun"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:124
msgid "先在 HTML 报告中找到失败案例及其输入模式、输出组合、布局和格式，再查看同名模块的日志。可用下面的命令缩小范围："
msgstr ""
"Find the failing case in the HTML report, including its input mode, output combination, layout, "
"and format. Then inspect the matching module log. Narrow down the failure with these commands:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:132
msgid "也可以重跑某份报告中的失败案例。在已经执行第 4 步的 PowerShell 终端中运行："
msgstr "You can also rerun failed cases from a report. In the PowerShell session from step 4, run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:138
msgid "先区分产品错误、过期的测试假设和环境问题，再处理失败。不要通过删除断言、把失败改成跳过或自动覆盖期望图片来获得通过结果。修复后必须再次执行第 3 步的全量严格检查。"
msgstr ""
"Determine whether the cause is an application defect, an outdated test assumption, or the "
"environment. Preserve assertions and expected images while investigating. Removing assertions, "
"skipping failures, or overwriting references can hide a regression. After the fix, repeat the "
"full strict run in step 3."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:140
msgid "第 6 步：为代码修改补充测试"
msgstr "Step 6. Add tests for the change"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:142
msgid ""
"新增案例放在 `auto_test_scripts/cases/test_*.py`，使用 unittest；入口会自动发现。多个输入、布局和输出组合应使用带明确参数的 "
"`subTest`，使失败报告能够定位具体组合。同步更新 `auto_test_scripts/coverage.json` 中的功能映射。"
msgstr ""
"Write unittest cases in `auto_test_scripts/cases/test_*.py` for automatic discovery. Use "
"parameterized `subTest` blocks for input, layout, and output combinations so reports identify the"
" failing combination. Update the feature mapping in `auto_test_scripts/coverage.json`."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:144
msgid "测试应使用固定素材或私有临时副本，避免依赖个人绝对路径、网络和用户文件。新增异步功能应检查任务依赖、内存准入、暂停、取消和关闭清理；新增保存功能应检查文件内容、实际格式和目录结构。"
msgstr ""
"Use fixed fixtures or private temporary copies. Avoid personal paths, network access, and user "
"files. For asynchronous changes, cover dependencies, memory admission, pause, cancellation, and "
"cleanup on close. For export changes, check contents, actual format, and directory structure."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:146
msgid ""
"只有在明确修改了素材规范时，才运行 `python auto_test_scripts/generate_assets.py`。同时审查素材生成规则、输入、期望结果和 "
"`manifest.json` 的变化，避免把错误输出当作新的正确答案。"
msgstr ""
"Run `python auto_test_scripts/generate_assets.py` only for deliberate fixture specification "
"changes. Review the generator, inputs, expected results, and `manifest.json` together to avoid "
"accepting incorrect output as a new reference."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:148
msgid "第 7 步：提交 PR 并附上测试报告"
msgstr "Step 7. Submit the pull request with its report"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:150
msgid "提交前确认代码和测试已经完成修改，再执行全量严格检查。PR 中说明修改目的、受影响功能、新增案例及仍需人工检查的项目，并填写 PR 模板中的回归验证部分。"
msgstr ""
"Finish code and test changes, then run the full strict suite. Explain the purpose, affected "
"features, new cases, and remaining manual checks in the PR. Complete the regression section of "
"the PR template."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:152
msgid ""
"提交 PR 后，在 GitHub Actions 中打开 **Functional regression report** 工作流，确认 `windows-regression` "
"任务通过，并下载对应提交的报告产物。把该次 CI 执行或产物的链接附在 PR 中；如果提供本地报告，应将 HTML、JSON、JUnit 和模块日志打包附上。"
msgstr ""
"Open the **Functional regression report** workflow in GitHub Actions after submission. Check that"
" `windows-regression` passed and download the report for the relevant commit. Link the CI run or "
"artifact in the PR. For local reports, bundle the HTML, JSON, JUnit results, and module logs."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:154
msgid ""
"自动生成的 `auto_test_scripts/reports` 已被 Git 忽略，不需要把每次日志提交到仓库。`baseline/verified.json` 是既有基线，不能替代本次 "
"PR 的报告。代码再次修改后，需要重新运行测试并更新报告链接。"
msgstr ""
"Git ignores generated `auto_test_scripts/reports`. Individual run logs do not need committing. "
"The existing `baseline/verified.json` is a historical baseline. Rerun the suite and update the "
"report link after subsequent edits."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:156
msgid ""
"维护者审查时，依次核对报告是否对应 PR 的最新提交、是否完成全量检查、失败和跳过是否得到解释，以及本次修改是否补充了相关案例。仓库管理员可在分支保护或仓库规则中，将 `windows-"
"regression` 设为必需检查，从而阻止测试失败的 PR 合并。"
msgstr ""
"Reviewers should check that the report matches the latest PR commit, covers the full suite, "
"explains any failures or skips, and includes cases for the change. Repository administrators can "
"make `windows-regression` a required check in branch protection or repository rules."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:158
msgid ""
"目前 CI 工作流配置为 Windows。Linux/macOS、实际 GPU 驱动与硬件、系统对话框外观及长时间运行仍应根据修改范围补充验证。详细案例和维护规则见 "
"`auto_test_scripts/README.md`。"
msgstr ""
"CI currently runs on Windows. Verify Linux/macOS, real GPU hardware and drivers, system dialog "
"appearance, and long-running behaviour where relevant. See `auto_test_scripts/README.md` for case"
" details and maintenance guidance."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:160
msgid "构建桌面离线包"
msgstr "Build offline desktop bundles"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:162
msgid ""
"**一次构建多个平台。** 在 GitHub 仓库进入 **Actions → Desktop packages → Run workflow**，选择分支并运行。矩阵分别在 Windows "
"x64、Linux x64/ARM64、macOS Intel/Apple Silicon 上构建。每项通过解压自检后才上传自己的 artifact；在运行详情页下载，解开 GitHub 外层 "
"ZIP 即可取得实际软件包。此操作只生成候选包，发布版本时再选择附件。"
msgstr ""
"**Build for multiple platforms at once.** In the GitHub repository, open **Actions → Desktop "
"packages → Run workflow**, choose a branch, and start the run. Jobs build natively for Windows "
"x64, Linux x64/ARM64, and Intel/Apple Silicon macOS. Each uploads its artifact after the "
"extracted bundle passes its check. Download the artifact from the run and open GitHub’s outer ZIP"
" to find the actual archive. Attach the desired artifacts when preparing a release."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:164
msgid ""
"**本机打包。** 在目标系统的 Git 工作副本根目录运行以下命令。Linux 需要图形桌面；无显示器时安装 Xvfb 和 xauth，并将最后一行换成 `xvfb-run -a python"
" tools/package_desktop.py --compact`。构建时需要联网获取依赖，并预留运行环境、压缩包和解压副本的空间。"
msgstr ""
"**Build locally.** Run the commands below from the root of a Git checkout on the target system. "
"Linux requires a graphical session. On a headless host, install Xvfb and xauth, then replace the "
"final command with `xvfb-run -a python tools/package_desktop.py --compact`. Allow network access for "
"dependencies and enough disk space for the runtime, archive, and extracted copy."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:172
msgid "三个平台都在 `dist/desktop/` 生成带有系统和架构名称的 `.tar.xz`。省略 `--compact` 时，Windows 使用 ZIP，Linux 和 macOS 使用 tar.gz。解压后按[下载与安装](../resources/install.md)启动。macOS 产物未经签名和公证，Linux 需要兼容的系统库和图形会话。"
msgstr "All three platforms write a `.tar.xz` named for the OS and architecture under `dist/desktop/`. Omitting `--compact` selects ZIP on Windows and tar.gz on Linux and macOS. After extraction, follow [Installation and verification](../resources/install.md). The macOS binary is unsigned and unnotarized. Linux requires compatible system libraries and a graphical session."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:174
msgid "**构建与验收。** 脚本按照 `environment.yml` 创建临时 Conda 环境，禁用个人默认加装包，并在临时环境中安装 PyInstaller。PyInstaller 以目录模式收集依赖，脚本显式加入 FFmpeg、FFprobe、内置算法和资源，解压自检通过后才输出归档。"
msgstr "**Build and verification.** The script creates a temporary Conda environment from `environment.yml`, skips user-configured default packages, and installs PyInstaller there. PyInstaller collects dependencies in directory mode. The build explicitly includes FFmpeg, FFprobe, bundled algorithms, and resources and publishes the archive after its extracted copy passes the self-check."

msgid "新增内置算法时，请将源文件和资源加入 Git。动态导入的算法依赖需加入构建环境并确认 PyInstaller 已收集。发布前请在干净的目标机器上打开两段视频、运行实际算法、导出并重新打开结果。"
msgstr "Add new bundled algorithm sources and resources to Git. Include dynamically imported dependencies in the build environment and verify that PyInstaller collects them. Before release, open two videos on a clean target machine, run the intended algorithms, export a page, and reopen it."

msgid "紧凑压缩保留相同的运行文件，以更多构建时间和临时磁盘空间换取更小的下载体积。"
msgstr "Compact compression preserves the runtime files and trades additional build time and temporary disk space for a smaller download."

msgid "比较打包器时，在 **Actions → Compare desktop packages** 对同一提交运行对照。每个原生平台分别生成 Conda 与 PyInstaller 目录版的 `.tar.xz`，用解压后的程序检查窗口、视频、内置算法和导出。任务摘要记录通过验证的下载字节数。请在相同系统及处理器架构下比较，并用实际要分发的自定义算法再试一次。"
msgstr ""
"Run **Actions → Compare desktop packages** on a single commit to compare packagers. Each native "
"platform builds Conda and PyInstaller onedir tar.xz archives and tests the extracted GUI, video, "
"built-in algorithm and exports. Each job summary records the verified download size in bytes. "
"Compare results on the same OS and architecture, then try the custom algorithms you plan to distribute."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:176
msgid "构建文档与维护翻译"
msgstr "Build the documentation and maintain translations"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:178
msgid "在仓库根目录执行以下命令，浏览器打开 `docs/_build/html/zh-cn/index.html`。要更新英文目录，先成功生成 POT，再运行翻译更新。"
msgstr ""
"Run these commands from the repository root, then open `docs/_build/html/zh-cn/index.html` in a "
"browser. Generate the POT templates successfully before updating the English catalogues."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:187
msgid "在 `docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/` 对应的 PO 文件填写或核对 `msgstr`，移除已确认条目的 fuzzy 标记。保持命令、路径和链接可用，随后运行："
msgstr ""
"Fill in or review each `msgstr` in the matching PO file under `docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/`. "
"Remove the fuzzy flag from reviewed entries. Preserve commands, paths, and link targets, then "
"run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:194
msgid "Read the Docs 使用各分支或标签中的 `.readthedocs.yaml`。构建只安装文档依赖，从检出的源码读取版本号和图标。"
msgstr "Read the Docs uses the configuration from each branch or tag. It installs the documentation dependencies and reads the version and icon directly from the checkout."

msgid "准备发布版本"
msgstr "Prepare a release"

msgid "维护者请按[新版本构建与发布](release.md)准备发布提交、验证安装包并推送正式标签。"
msgstr "See [Build and publish a release](release.md) to prepare the release commit, verify packages and push the release tag."

msgid "新增界面语言时，在 `src/mulimgviewer/src/languages.py` 登记稳定的语言代码、菜单名称和手册路径，在 `src/mulimgviewer/src/locales/<code>.json` 添加 UTF-8 译表。参考已有译表，保留英文键、格式占位符、快捷键和技术参数。运行配置回归测试，核对语言切换、设置保存与重置。"
msgstr "Register a stable code, native menu name and guide path in `src/mulimgviewer/src/languages.py`. Add a UTF-8 catalog at `src/mulimgviewer/src/locales/<code>.json`. Preserve English keys, format fields, shortcuts and technical parameters. Run the configuration regressions for switching, saving and resetting languages."

msgid "在清单指定的位置编写快速指南，运行 `python tools/release.py --prepare` 同步多语言文档入口。用 `python -m sphinx -W -b html -D language=ja docs docs/_build/html/ja` 可单独检查日语，替换语言代码即可检查其他语言。README 链接到同一入口。"
msgstr "Write the quick start at the registered path and run `python tools/release.py --prepare` to sync the documentation directory. Preview Japanese with `python -m sphinx -W -b html -D language=ja docs docs/_build/html/ja`, substituting another language code as needed. Both READMEs link to the same directory."

